106.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122106.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nAdds unit tests for `Math::snap_scalar()`.\r\nCovers delegation to `snapped()` when `p_offset == 0`, all 8\r\nsign combinations of `(p_offset, p_step, p_target)`, `p_step == 0`\r\nignoring `p_offset`, exact on-grid targets, tie-break behavior with\r\na non-zero offset, and a few additional cases with arbitrary\r\nnon-round decimal values for general coverage.\r\n\r\nNo production code changed.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n**AI disclosure:** I designed and hand-calculated all test cases myself.\r\nI used an AI assistant (Claude) to help debug a few git/build issues\r\nas well as to format and check the grammar of this PR description.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122106/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}